TI  -  'Always Nice and Confident, Sometimes Wrong': Developer's Experiences Engaging Generative AI Chatbots Versus Human-Powered Q&amp;A Platforms
AU  - Li, Jiachen
AU  - Mynatt, Elizabeth D.
AU  - Mishra, Varun
